  <Strings>
    <Section>Npc</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274120</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>悪い魔女の噂聞いた？
私ね、あれ魔女じゃないと
思うのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have you heard those "wicked
witch" rumors? Well, personally,
I don't think there is any witch...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274120</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>噂なんて
あてにならないもの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You just can't trust
rumors, you know.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>魔女ってことはさ
魔法が使える
つまりエルフってことよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, witches can use magic,
can't they? In other words,
she'd have to be an elf, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでエルフがエルフの村に
住んでないの？
おかしいじゃない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why would an elf be living
outside the elf village? It just
doesn't make sense, does it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>虹輪は昔の不発兵器のせい
なんだって、知ってたかしら？
怖いわね～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, did you know? The Prism Ring was
caused by some very, very old 'unexploded
ordnance'. Awfully scary, don't you think~?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでもその後の調査で、
その兵器ってヤツが村の地下から
ぞくぞく見つかったんですって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And then they were investigating the cause,
and the further underground they looked,
the more of that 'ordnance' they found.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274132</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>全部撤去したとか言ってるけど、
どうかしら、まだ残ってたり
するんじゃないかしら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They said they disposed of it all,
but is that really true? What if
there's still some left down there?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274132</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>戦争なんて過去の出来事だと
思ってたけど、まだ身近に
その跡があるものなのね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've always thought of war as just a
part of history. And to think, there were
still remnants of it so close to home.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274136</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>道具屋のオーナーの奥さんったら
売り上げごっそり全部持って
逃げたらしいわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I hear the item shop's owner's
wife stole every last bit of their
profits, and left home with it all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274136</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どこかへ逃げたか知らないわよ。
かわいそうに、
ご主人ショック受けて</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But no one knows where she
ran off to. It's just so awful, isn't
it? Her husband must be shocked...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274140</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>街の中の袂に立って、
夜な夜なガルド金貨を投げてる
髭の男の人がいるんですって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They say there's a man with a beard
who stands near the town center in the
dead of night and throws Gald coins.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274140</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでも紅の月の鉱山を
営んでる社長さんなんですって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Some even say it's the president of
the Crimson Moon mining company.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274140</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お金がありすぎて、
どうかしちゃったのかしら</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Perhaps all that money
finally drove him mad.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274144</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さて、今晩の飯は
何にするかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, what will we
have to eat tonight...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274144</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そろそろ、変な詮索やめて
家事に専念してほしいな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It'd be nice if my wife would quit
her strange 'investigations' and
just focus on the housework...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274148</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うちの妻、
ちまたのニュースに
興味を持つのはいいんだけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm glad my wife pays attention
to our local goings-on, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274148</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>家事を放り出すんだよ。
どうしたらいいかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She's neglecting the housework.
What do I do about that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やぁ、&lt;Dio&gt;くんに
&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃんかい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, hey, if it isn't
&lt;Dio&gt; and &lt;Mel&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当になんとかして欲しいよ、
あの噂好きのうちの妻を</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'd really like if you'd help
me out with that rumor-
loving wife of mine.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>「なりきり士」の力で
なんとか……ならないよね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can't do anything about it
with your "Roleplayer" powers,
can you...? No, I guess not...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いつも結局、炊事洗濯は
僕の仕事、うちの奥さんは
あの通り噂話の収集に余念がない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In the end, it's always me doing cooking
and dishes. My wife never finds the time,
as focused as she is on her rumors.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>世の中のいろんなことに
関心持つのは悪いことじゃ
ないと思うけどさ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't think there's anything wrong
with taking an interest in all the
things that go on in the world, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もっと、目の前にあること
大切にするべきだと
思うんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I do think you should value
the things right in front
of you most of all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当にどこで聞いてくるんだか、
うちの奥さん、毎度の噂好きで
困っちゃうよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Where does my wife even
hear all these rumors? It's
really getting out of hand.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いっそのこと、自分が
噂話の中心にでもなれば、
くだらない噂話やめるかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe if someone started
spreading rumors about her,
she'd finally stop all this...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなに噂が好きなら
自分が噂の人物になれば
いいんだ、まったく……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyone who loves rumors this much should
just become a subject of rumor themselves,
then see how much they like it. I swear...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、それがいい……
僕が奥さん捨てて家を出れば
それも実現するな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You know what...? I'll just leave her at
home and disappear. People will surely
spread rumors about that, won't they...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>世界が終わる……
誰も我々を守ってくれないのか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So this is how the world ends...
Is there no one who will save us...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>半年前にダオスと戦った
時空戦士が現れたように、
２度は奇跡は起こらないのか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Heroes of Time appeared and fought
Dhaos just half a year ago. Is it too
much to ask for another miracle like them?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……仕方がない、
あの子を守れるのは
自分しかいないのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I guess that's that, then.
I'll just have to protect
my daughter myself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>できる限り、戦ってみせる。
これが父の強さだと
人に知らしめるために</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll put up as much of a fight
as I can. I'll show them just
what a real father's made of.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うちは娘と私のふたり暮らしだ。
妻は３年前、出ていった
今でも理由はよくわからない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We live here, just me and my daughter.
My wife left us three years ago,
and I never found out why.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ただ、一族の掟が、とか
そんなことを言って
消えてしまった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>All she said was, "it's the code of
my clan." She left me with those
words and then just...vanished.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うまくやっていた、
そのつもりだったのに、
一体、彼女はどうして……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I really thought everything was
going great between us. Why
did she just...all of a sudden...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>きっとやむにやまれぬ事情が
あったに違いないのです。
それは何だったのだ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm certain that, whatever her reasons,
she didn't really have a choice. But still,
what could those reasons have been...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すくすくと育っている娘の
姿を見るのだけが、今の
私の生きがいなのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right now, my life's purpose is
just to watch over our daughter.
She's growing up so fast, now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかし、今でも夢を見ます、
妻と同じようにどこかへ
消えていなくなる娘の夢を</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I've had a recurring dream, of
late. A dream where my daughter
vanishes, just like my wife did.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今度こそ、娘を守ってみせる、
得体の知れない力から</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But this time, I'll protect my daughter
by my own hand. No matter what
bizarre powers I must fight against.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>妻が消えてしまったように
その状況をやすやすと
受け入れてなるものか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've already lost my
wife. I'm not going to
lose my daughter, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お外が騒がしいの……
みんな悲鳴とか怒る声とか
あげて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's so noisy outside...
Everyone's crying, or
screaming angrily, or...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうしちゃったの、みんな
こわいの？　こわくなんてないよ？
だってパパが守ってくれるもん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What happened? Why's everyone
so scared? I'm not scared at all.
'Cause my papa will protect me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274196</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うちのパパは
世界一強いんだよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And my papa's stronger than
anyone else in the whole world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274196</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何があっても
あたしを守るって
約束してくれたもん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And he promised he'll
protect me, no matter
what happens.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274200</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この家、お母さんいないの。
前はいたんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mom doesn't live here.
But she used to, I think.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274200</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でもお母さんとかなくても
いいの。パパがいれば、
他は何もいらない！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I'm fine without Mom.
As long as I have my papa,
I don't need anything else!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274204</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>パパはね、「いつかパパより
１番のものができるよ」って
悲しいこと言うの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My papa tells me, "Someday there will be
someone you like even more than Papa,"
and he sounds so sad when he says it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274204</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなこと絶対ないのにね、
いつまでもパパが１番に
決まってるじゃん∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But there's no way that will
happen. Papa will always be
my favorite in the whole world! ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お母さんの荷物が
押入れの中にあるのを
見つけちゃった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I found a lot of Mom's
things in the closet.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まだパパ、お母さんのこと、
忘れてないんだね、
私なんて全然覚えてないのに</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Papa still hasn't forgotten
Mom. I don't remember
her at all, though.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>家を出てったお母さんの荷物、
なんか変なんだよね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But the things Mom left
here when she left are
all kinda weird.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>短い刀とか、十字型した武器とか
巻物とか、鉄の爪ついた縄とか。
コレ何なのかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's a short sword, and cross-shaped
weapons, and scrolls, and ropes with iron
claws stuck to them. What's it all for?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
